{"parentUuid":"81236512-be96-4d7e-8503-4a6f25f639dd","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a2392aaec64306cb2","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cfp3TyF88nu1Bq3VpTLff","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C464YtmWJwaTYrgXk2GRmf","name":"SubagentHandback","input":{"message":"Implemented the Job (case) feature end-to-end, following the dossier/timeline bridge conventions.\n\nNew files:\n- mes-log-mcp/mes/jobs.py — append-only JSONL store (jobs.jsonl) with open/close/add_hypothesis/set_hypothesis/add_action/attach/load/get/current(vin). Evidence refs are never invented; `attach()` routes a ref either to a hypothesis's evidence_for/against or to the job's own link lists (symptom_ids, note_ids, media_ids, feedback_ids, service_record_ids, inspection_ids) by ref kind.\n- cuore/services/jobs_bridge.py — build_job_view(vin, job_id=None) gathers real evidence from dossier_bridge, timeline_bridge, mes_bridge (notes/dealer results), and electrical_bridge/systems_bridge (both guarded, degrade to empty if absent). suggested_hypotheses() builds \"EVAP: ESIM signal path\" and \"EVAP: ECM calibration\" (plus a network one) only when the dossier's real open-work names that family, pulling evidence_for/against from real freeze-frame flags, actuator history, bulletins, dealer SLVT results, and returned-after-clear codes.\n- cuore/api/jobs.py — JSON CRUD mirroring the bridge.\n- cuore/web/jobs_routes.py + cuore/web/templates/job.html — the `/v/{vin}/job` page with the 7-step stepper, all plain no-JS forms (open case, add/promote hypothesis, 44px status buttons, record action, close with required outcome).\n- cuore/tests/check_jobs_page.py — 5 scenarios (21 checks): open via form, EVAP suggestion with ≥1 real evidence ref, action+hypothesis-status round trip, close-requires-outcome, and a 400px screenshot with zero horizontal overflow (screenshot saved to scratchpad/job_phone.png, viewed — renders cleanly).\n\nEdits: mes-log-mcp/server.py (added job_open/job_current/job_add_action/job_set_hypothesis MCP tools), cuore/app.py (added jobs_api/jobs_routes imports and include_router calls only — left the existing report_routes import/include lines untouched), cuore/web/templates/_vbar.html (added the Job tab link right after Dossier — note a concurrent process had also added a Modules tab; both coexist fine), cuore/web/static/cuore.css (appended a small job-page section at the end of the file, per its existing convention).\n\nVerified: check_jobs_page.py (21/21) and check_api.py (96/96, unmodified) both pass. Did not touch app.py's report lines, mes-log-mcp/mes/* other than the new jobs.py, or any systems_*/electrical_*/layout_* file."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_read_input_tokens":237580,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":240,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01C464YtmWJwaTYrgXk2GRmf":{"message":"Implemented the Job (case) feature end-to-end, following the dossier/timeline bridge conventions.\n\nNew files:\n- mes-log-mcp/mes/jobs.py — append-only JSONL store (jobs.jsonl) with open/close/add_hypothesis/set_hypothesis/add_action/attach/load/get/current(vin). Evidence refs are never invented; `attach()` routes a ref either to a hypothesis's evidence_for/against or to the job's own link lists (symptom_ids, note_ids, media_ids, feedback_ids, service_record_ids, inspection_ids) by ref kind.\n- cuore/services/jobs_bridge.py — build_job_view(vin, job_id=None) gathers real evidence from dossier_bridge, timeline_bridge, mes_bridge (notes/dealer results), and electrical_bridge/systems_bridge (both guarded, degrade to empty if absent). suggested_hypotheses() builds \"EVAP: ESIM signal path\" and \"EVAP: ECM calibration\" (plus a network one) only when the dossier's real open-work names that family, pulling evidence_for/against from real freeze-frame flags, actuator history, bulletins, dealer SLVT results, and returned-after-clear codes.\n- cuore/api/jobs.py — JSON CRUD mirroring the bridge.\n- cuore/web/jobs_routes.py + cuore/web/templates/job.html — the `/v/{vin}/job` page with the 7-step stepper, all plain no-JS forms (open case, add/promote hypothesis, 44px status buttons, record action, close with required outcome).\n- cuore/tests/check_jobs_page.py — 5 scenarios (21 checks): open via form, EVAP suggestion with ≥1 real evidence ref, action+hypothesis-status round trip, close-requires-outcome, and a 400px screenshot with zero horizontal overflow (screenshot saved to scratchpad/job_phone.png, viewed — renders cleanly).\n\nEdits: mes-log-mcp/server.py (added job_open/job_current/job_add_action/job_set_hypothesis MCP tools), cuore/app.py (added jobs_api/jobs_routes imports and include_router calls only — left the existing report_routes import/include lines untouched), cuore/web/templates/_vbar.html (added the Job tab link right after Dossier — note a concurrent process had also added a Modules tab; both coexist fine), cuore/web/static/cuore.css (appended a small job-page section at the end of the file, per its existing convention).\n\nVerified: check_jobs_page.py (21/21) and check_api.py (96/96, unmodified) both pass. Did not touch app.py's report lines, mes-log-mcp/mes/* other than the new jobs.py, or any systems_*/electrical_*/layout_* file."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ded51bcc-f671-472b-9a49-9c83139a9b94","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfp3TxzVPyUL7qggFjj1R","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"9241264a-e15b-4193-be49-5fcbe4190394","timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:15:50.171Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf